# Face previews use Vite's same-origin /illustration-api proxy to the local
# service on 127.0.0.1:8766. See ml/scenario-visualization/LOCAL_SETUP.md.

# Set these together to use the authenticated AWS backend instead of local previews.
# VITE_REST_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.example
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-public-publishable-or-anon-key
# Never put MODEL_SERVICE_TOKEN, DATABASE_URL or a Supabase service-role key here.
